2. The system displays an appropriate error message. \newline
3. Return to step 3 of the main flow.
} \\ \hline

Exceptions: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{

\textbf{EX-01: Saved Search Not Found} \textit{(branch at step 6)} \newline
